{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "036V", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$X' \\to X$", "MATH_0003": "$X' \\to Y$", "MATH_0004": "$X' \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0006": "$X' \\to Y$", "MATH_0007": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0008": "$X \\to Y$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-properties-morphisms-local-source}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-locally-quasi-finite-characterize}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-composition-quasi-finite}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-etale-locally-quasi-finite}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-finite-type-local-source-fppf-algebra}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-quasi-finite}", "REF_0007": "\\ref{lemma-properties-morphisms-local-source}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:37c1698c1728e9e5c61cd91acf2c26bf84b2fc1a5d39dcbfa58bf2e6ffbd6341", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ef0da2e70d56c84df6e06791f0a5e83c5f423c639ef2ca5fa346671851d77ad0", "source_text": "We are going to use\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nBy\nMorphisms, Lemma\n<REF_0002>\nthe property of being locally quasi-finite is local for Zariski on source\nand target. By\nMorphisms, Lemmas\n<REF_0003> and\n<REF_0004>\nwe see the precomposition\nof a locally quasi-finite morphism by an <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism is locally\nquasi-finite. Finally, suppose that <MATH_0001> is a morphism of affine schemes\nand that <MATH_0002> is a surjective <ACCENT_0002>tale morphism of affine schemes\nsuch that <MATH_0003> is locally quasi-finite. Then <MATH_0004> is of finite\ntype, and by\nLemma <REF_0005>\nwe see that <MATH_0005> is of finite type also.\nMoreover, by assumption <MATH_0006> has finite fibres, and hence <MATH_0007>\nhas finite fibres also. We conclude that <MATH_0008> is quasi-finite by\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0006>.\nThis proves the last assumption of\nLemma <REF_0007>\nand finishes the proof.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5da93ef528198b104dba0a7e6911815e553bc9af7a015e51764ec08068f3c43f", "unit_id": "tag:03X4:proof"}
